      "statement": "HarnessProfile.excluded_middleware strips middleware (by class or by .name string) from the fully assembled stack including instances passed via create_deep_agent(middleware=[...]); required scaffolding (FilesystemMiddleware, SubAgentMiddleware) cannot be excluded and entries matching nothing are rejected, both validated to fail fast.",
