      "statement": "excluded_tools is enforced by appending a _ToolExclusionMiddleware after tool-injecting and custom middleware so it removes both user-supplied and middleware-added tools and cannot be restored by a custom wrap_model_call; the same exclusion set applies to the main agent, the general-purpose subagent, and declarative synchronous subagents.",
