      "statement": "Built-in profiles load lazily on first registry access via a once-per-interpreter, thread-safe bootstrap that registers built-ins first (raising loudly on failure and rolling back), then discovers third-party plugins through the deepagents.provider_profiles and deepagents.harness_profiles entry-point groups, isolating plugin failures.",
